#: ../../source/docs/modules/serial.rst:3 9a827ca4a5434619b09d9ded31a65286
msgid "Writing to Serial Port"
msgstr "写入串口"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/serial.rst:9 175075ca5c8543469d3535acaf42ed77
msgid ""
"Allows transmission of data packets through the serial ports on the APM via "
"MAVProxy (ie. remote control of the serial ports). Use ``serial lock`` and "
"``serial unlock`` to give (or release) exclusive control of the serial "
"ports."
msgstr ""
"允许通过 MAVProxy 经由 APM 上的串口传输数据包（即串口远程控制）。使用 ``serial lock`` 和 ``serial "
"unlock`` 授予（或释放）串口的独占控制权。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/serial.rst:14 cc9398a1a38a472184cb024d029b2e7a
msgid ""
"To change to serial port settings use ``serial set [setting] [value]``, "
"where setting can be port, baudrate or timeout. To send data, enter ``serial"
" send [data]``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``serial set [setting] [value]`` 更改串口设置，setting 可为 port、baudrate 或 "
"timeout。使用 ``serial send [data]`` 发送数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/serial.rst:18 1cbb3a8457414c229fe2a0e68b6d2aee
msgid "Any received serial data will be output to the console."
msgstr "接收到的串口数据将输出到控制台。"
